[{"title":"续梅花百咏 其七十九 琴屋梅","author":"陶德勋","text":"琼花枝畔展瑶琴，屡次弹来觅赏音。\n格调漫疑人不识，高山流水有知心。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44089,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"续梅花百咏 其八十 城头梅","author":"陶德勋","text":"烟罩寒枝隐暮鸦，夕阳返照似丹霞。\n寄言关吏须珍重，此是人间五福花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44090,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"续梅花百咏 其八十一 竹梅","author":"陶德勋","text":"斜来竹外映涟漪，疏影摇风水弄枝。\n远岸深林春最好，清光一色与人宜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44091,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"续梅花百咏 其八十二 水月梅","author":"陶德勋","text":"水中月里色清凉，一树琼花两映光。\n最是玲珑尘不染，重重叠叠玉成庄。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44092,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"续梅花百咏 其八十三 担上梅","author":"陶德勋","text":"春来春日采春华，折取春风白玉花。\n藉问满肩春色拥，匆匆挑得赠谁家。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44093,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"续梅花百咏 其八十四 杖头梅","author":"陶德勋","text":"折得琼花系短筇，杖来随我度春风。\n缓行稳步游何处，香送长亭驿路中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44094,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"续梅花百咏 其八十五 隔帘梅","author":"陶德勋","text":"仙姿玉质貌堂堂，月过东墙夜拂光。\n满室清风春引入，帘虽隔断也闻香。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44095,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"续梅花百咏 其八十六 照镜梅","author":"陶德勋","text":"菱镜妆窥不怨残，春光未到耐严寒。\n从知脸瘦精神好，证出全身倚画栏。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44096,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"续梅花百咏 其八十七 十月梅","author":"陶德勋","text":"众卉无知却有知，时乘阴剥放偏迟。\n休云菊后花开尽，春到小阳玉满枝。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44097,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"续梅花百咏 其八十八 二月梅","author":"陶德勋","text":"桃花开日又梅开，留恋春风去复来。\n玉质难为红雨妒，山城独自舞徘徊。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44098,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"续梅花百咏 其八十九 未开梅","author":"陶德勋","text":"雪中香脸雨中腮，久结冰胎尚未开。\n知是东君无别意，春光恐漏莫相猜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44099,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"续梅花百咏 其九十 乍开梅","author":"陶德勋","text":"谁将消息报春光，昨夜庭前忽有香。\n可是枝间初破玉，蓦然帘外露新妆。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44100,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"续梅花百咏 其九十一 半开梅","author":"陶德勋","text":"山欲冲寒气未温，春风不肯到梅村。\n芳姿半露冰胎外，偏使香留月下魂。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44101,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"续梅花百咏 其九十二 全开梅","author":"陶德勋","text":"玉枝开遍拥浓阴，勾引黄蜂入院深。\n最好春光歌一曲，高人乘兴动清吟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44102,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"续梅花百咏 其九十三 zk墨梅","author":"陶德勋","text":"浓画容颜淡画心，枝头点缀浅兼深。\n频知墨水将花泼，烟浪生光到满林。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44103,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"续梅花百咏 其九十四 画红梅","author":"陶德勋","text":"品高何事妒红裙，丰骨飘飘任醉醺。\n羡尔画工真手笔，丹霞绘出胜青云。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44104,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"续梅花百咏 其九十五 玉笛梅","author":"陶德勋","text":"梅花岂果落江城，玉笛吹来体自轻。\n素影和声何处去，香清韵远两多情。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44105,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"续梅花百咏 其九十六 纸帐梅","author":"陶德勋","text":"不依槛外露华光，纸帐微微暗度香。\n只恐红罗将色掩，故教玉版透清凉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44106,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"续梅花百咏 其九十七 何逊梅","author":"陶德勋","text":"廨舍香浓叶复稠，一时名誉播扬州。\n行看退食将花咏，好句搜来笔岂投。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44107,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"续梅花百咏 其九十八 广平梅","author":"陶德勋","text":"劲节孤芳秉性真，堍花名相两相亲。\n鸿篇赋就谁能匹，写出清刚笔有神。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44108,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"续梅花百咏 其九十九 绿萼梅","author":"陶德勋","text":"寒花开遍似仙妃，不著红裙著绿衣。\n岂是女神遭九烈，多挥柳汁入重帏。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44109,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"续梅花百咏 其一○○ 朱砂梅","author":"陶德勋","text":"春风吹遍万千家，飘染丹砂第一花。\n知是东皇深酝酿，红云捧出护窗纱。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44110,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夜半泊邵伯驿访龚甫","author":"许传霈","text":"落月天河朗，危樯独夜开。\n故人忘寂寞，游子几徘徊。\n灯火前堤灭，钟声野寺来。\n高楼言不尽，画角漫相催。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44111,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"中秋坐月 其一","author":"许传霈","text":"汤汤淮水长，片片秋云洁。\n客来自何方，三度良宵月。\n今夜月独明，清光白虚堂。\n中庭起徘徊，疏星淡欲灭。\n虫语四壁围，人影卧阶石。\n何处生清风，飘飘乱我发。\n身已到蓬莱，广寒近咫尺。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44112,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"游都昌南山 其一","author":"王以慜","text":"南郭春光泼酒浓，鄱湖山翠落杯中。\n明朝归客扬舲去，梦断桃花一夜风。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44113,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"游都昌南山 其二","author":"王以慜","text":"貂冠远隔九重门，偶逐渔舟到水村。\n羞向山僧话名姓，家居旧是武陵源。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44114,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"蒋公岭","author":"王以慜","text":"流水东西沙复沙，荒村背郭几人家。\n千条翠缕王恭柳，满地黄金张翰花。\n故里何人搴杜若，空山无地饭胡麻。\n匡君隔岸频招手，彭蠡门前噪晚鸦。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44115,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"中秋坐月 其二","author":"许传霈","text":"万籁齐寂寞，霏露湿阑干。\n当空悬皓魄，俯仰心自宽。\n老母怜小儿，为倚门闾看。\n相看复相思，天涯游子寒。\n前年度江北，长歌行路难。\n去年分淮水，来照白头单。\n安能离别者，如此月团栾。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44116,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"得乐斋补弟子员信诗以复之","author":"许传霈","text":"差慰书香不断传，归来先咏采芹篇。\n狼烟以后千馀里，鸡曙从前二十年。\n漫道青衿同拾芥，敢将晚岁废良田。\n淹留独笑小痴叔，犹住江南黄叶天。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44117,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"人生","author":"许传霈","text":"满地冰霜斗室居，虽然困顿亦舒徐。\n懒思尘世无穷事，补读吾生有用书。\n饭罢聊将閒步数，睡馀常觉客心虚。\n忘言自得静中趣，过尽门来显者车。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44118,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"将之松江藉以南旋","author":"许传霈","text":"昔日偶然来江北，今朝无计到江南。\n渡头开落花千万，海上望归人两三。\n怕听画梁新燕语，相期春雨故园谈。\n此心已惹乡关梦，贺鉴湖清澄碧岚。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44119,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"去淮阴留别诸友 其一","author":"许传霈","text":"未满相知愿，天涯共客时。\n三年非小聚，千里饯新诗。\n柳色阳关曲，桃花潭水思。\n西湖山色好，相会不须期。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44120,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"去淮阴留别诸友 其二","author":"许传霈","text":"来去清淮水，葭莩接旧欢。\n不期因患难，重作旧团栾。\n萱草高堂树，车黄行路难。\n斯时无限语，尺素道加餐。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44121,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"三月四日侍母登舟谢淮阴诸友送至宝应","author":"许传霈","text":"冠盖动淮阴，河梁携手吟。\n此乡多蕴结，永夜慰胸襟。\n百里联床梦，扁舟故友心。\n相逢终欲别，不尽玉杯斟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44122,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"去淮时有旧婢夜哭岸上，诗以纪之","author":"许传霈","text":"生成乡里作夫妻，懊恼今朝不我携。\n留得十年相忆泪，随波送去自淮西。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44123,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"登金山绝顶","author":"许传霈","text":"长峙大江东，登临感慨中。\n塔孤飞鸟疾，潮落夕阳红。\n烽火千山垒，回樯万里风。\n残碑寻不得，绝顶起烟濛。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44124,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"渡扬子江","author":"许传霈","text":"风送潮头急，扁舟雪浪抛。\n两峰巍伏虎，一水气腾蛟。\n洞辟渔翁宿，樯高飞鸟巢。\n中流诗思阔，无处著推敲。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44125,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"进越河口入江南界矣，随书所见 其一","author":"许传霈","text":"计渡扬子江，哀鸿来满目。\n老弱或提携，终朝断复续。\n百里无炊烟，残垒争露宿。\n滩头罗拜迎，哀向我舟哭。\n舟人未成言，风送片帆速。\n仰天顿地呼，口乾呼不复。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44126,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"进越河口入江南界矣，随书所见 其二","author":"许传霈","text":"遥指南兰陵，血战降强虏。\n生聚悲十年，宫室尽禾黍。\n白骨何累累，隐约随篙橹。\n当春长荻芦，白日泣风雨。\n世无滴血儿，何时安抔土。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44127,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"进越河口入江南界矣，随书所见 其三","author":"许传霈","text":"郊原有人耕，茅屋数椽治。\n姑苏城不遥，渐有可人意。\n冠盖喧金阊，笙歌集廛肆。\n共欣物华鲜，已忘沧桑异。\n舟送遗孑归，衢读劝农示。\n大吏正招徕，流民何异地。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44128,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"丹阳道中","author":"许传霈","text":"一塔指朝暾，巍然雉堞存。\n断碑留胜迹，残垒吊忠魂。\n草长凄风帚，桥连旧日村。\n伤心遗士卒，犹说向军门。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44129,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"暮泊无锡乡间","author":"许传霈","text":"苍茫增暮色，何处住行踪。\n芳草人烟冷，桃花夜雨浓。\n结邻双小艇，偶语半吴侬。\n赢得终宵梦，时知靖远峰。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44130,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"苏城寻伯兄不值","author":"许传霈","text":"我闻此地好吹埙，把酒船头已待温。\n谁道北归鸿有序，偏逢南去雁销魂。\n万家烟火重城锁，千里相思雪浪奔。\n孤棹不堪连夜雨，更迷云树到阊门。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44131,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"泊青浦得伯兄馆奉贤之信","author":"许传霈","text":"荒城如斗大，兵火话频年。\n垂柳萦孤棹，斜阳搁晚烟。\n无聊游子意，难得故人贤。\n传语平安字，之邦别有缘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44132,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"舟抵云间","author":"许传霈","text":"青山白水赴茸城，晓岸鸣鸡夹橹迎。\n短堞云开孤塔影，一湖风送夜潮声。\n浮家到处成新眷，好友逢时證夙盟。\n又是昏黄团话旧，洒窗微雨亦关情。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44133,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"子方招游上海","author":"许传霈","text":"约我乘潮买钓舟，分明补作昔年游。\n壶觞此夜亲朋酒，粉黛谁家歌舞楼。\n日落江边胡马嘶，月明海上锦囊收。\n一隅差喜东南守，应许连朝忘客愁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44134,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"伯兄由奉贤来松江连床三日 其一","author":"许传霈","text":"患难思骨肉，终夜不能忘。\n梦去似相见，约略话连床。\n嗟哉我兄弟，寥落参与商。\n秦晋非谓远，道路阻何长。\n昨朝系便鸿，裂帛寄衷肠。\n晓闻啼好鸟，何期来远方。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44135,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"伯兄由奉贤来松江连床三日 其二","author":"许传霈","text":"谁不苦离别，反喜新把袂。\n入门各自言，悲欢集斯际。\n鬓发未全颁，重裘尽凋敝。\n沦落本无家，沧桑经此世。\n当头风木悲，抔土逾五载。\n中庭悬画图，潜然欲流涕。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44136,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"伯兄由奉贤来松江连床三日 其三","author":"许传霈","text":"人生若朝露，溘忽不可留。\n矧以弱鲁质，际此多难秋。\n客地雅难乐，亲朋结良俦。\n移我新浊酿，涤此无尽愁。\n酡颜不久热，相对复何求。\n富贵岂不愿，何以善贻谋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44137,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"伯兄由奉贤来松江连床三日 其四","author":"许传霈","text":"偶得箧中书，昔日所雠校。\n纸色殊苍黄，字迹忆年少。\n物兮且容易，人能不抚吊。\n清白永家传，酸辛闻母教。\n无乃饥渴驱，来朝催孤棹。\n不住夜潮流，东门凝远眺。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44138,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"旅居杂兴 其一","author":"许传霈","text":"垂柳平桥人屋小，碧桃对岸雨时浓。\n潮来滚滚潆城水，风度声声近寺钟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44139,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"旅居杂兴 其二","author":"许传霈","text":"画梁学语初巢燕，少妇缫丝已熟蚕。\n一枕病馀临米帖，三竿日暖诵周南。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44140,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"旅居杂兴 其三","author":"许传霈","text":"满院开残红白桃，盈樽人倒浊清醪。\n相逢重午还相醉，小会神仙吊楚骚。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44141,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"旅居杂兴 其四","author":"许传霈","text":"漫道关河睽隔苦，犹欣羁旅笑言真。\n淮徐风月苏松酒，许与劳人作主人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44142,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"方正学祠","author":"许传霈","text":"天教正学振遗风，瞻拜荒祠泪我公。\n不是昵儿赖魏尉，茸城何处广求忠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44143,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"将去松江用子耘赠行诗韵留别诸友","author":"许传霈","text":"小住茸城雅意投，行踪聚散等萍浮。\n九峰三泖留游迹，浅唱低斟涤客愁。\n阅世人多羞看剑，趁潮门近系归舟。\n黯然一样清淮别，乱擘蛮笺漫挽留。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44144,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"抵家大水","author":"许传霈","text":"一棹计归程，半月熟梅雨。\n河梁碍舟车，羁旅愁閒阻。\n家门拓地开，流水浸环堵。\n解缆服窗棂，傍阶搁篙橹。\n闻说撼海塘，昨决丈尺土。\n翻潮入内河，浩瀚不得禦。\n朝倾东家墙，夕淹西邻宇。\n奥堂鱼鳖乡，城市蛟蜃户。\n有客住高楼，招我我心许。\n极目慨汪洋，郊原而江渚。\n高田无豆麦，遑云插禾黍。\n流民才赋归，又嗟空轴杼。\n日暮遇相知，蹙頞从头语。\n钱塘浪接天，靡烂尤荼苦。\n松楸破鲸流，苍黔无鸠聚。\n海若知未知，使我痛肺腑。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44145,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"催妆曲 其一","author":"许传霈","text":"诵到周南第一篇，离乱仍得假良缘。\n本来牛女是相识，小别人间十二年。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44146,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"催妆曲 其二","author":"许传霈","text":"寻常嫁娶了初衷，地下应知笑语同。\n新妇未谙慈母意，姑烧红烛话公公。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44147,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"催妆曲 其三","author":"许传霈","text":"初试烹调入灶厨，荆钗裙布雅相须。\n同侪操作同生母，妯娌还将姊妹呼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44148,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"催妆曲 其四","author":"许传霈","text":"牛衣终夜说王章，佐我机声刻漏长。\n惭愧画眉一支笔，寒窗祗合写催妆。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44149,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"上元日留赠伯兄 其一","author":"许传霈","text":"每因省墓殡，买棹至城西。\n剩有黄家宇，难忘昔日栖。\n里邻悲离散，风雨感凄迷。\n赢得元宵饮，相逢醉若泥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44150,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"上元日留赠伯兄 其二","author":"许传霈","text":"大智从愚起，而今觉太愚。\n兄怀诚似拙，弟号合称迂。\n对客愁何底，忘情语转无。\n莫能筹极计，且自课儿雏。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44151,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"上元日留赠伯兄 其三","author":"许传霈","text":"雁序才连昨，分飞别犹匆。\n不图归故里，依旧感飘蓬。\n三月烟花艳，长江尺素通。\n临岐言约略，不尽寸心中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44152,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"二月二十六日展先大人墓","author":"许传霈","text":"触景悲风木，茫茫五度春。\n伤心一抔土，犹未安先人。\n墓草年年绿，堤杨冉冉新。\n初成寒食奠，无限泪沾巾。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44153,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"同日展长嫂钱孺人墓，见幼妹附殡倾圮，复成一律","author":"许传霈","text":"爱妹反欺妹，荒凉一破棺。\n那堪三岁小，耐受十年寒。\n浩劫经时变，崇封愧我难。\n尚依阿嫂氏，长夜慰漫漫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44154,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"兵燹后五年不墓祭矣，成一律寄伯兄","author":"许传霈","text":"祭扫原循故，凄凉奈此情。\n纸灰一抔土，烟柳五清明。\n宿草留前泪，斜阳趁晚晴。\n遥知孤棹客，涕泗倍盈盈。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44155,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"吊陈鲁斋兄丈","author":"许传霈","text":"携杖萝岩下，高风羡岸然。\n青蓝联旧契，葭莩托良缘。\n孰意今把袂，为时未届年。\n大风一曲后，遽尔渺云烟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44156,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题袁柘林小影用其兄香溪韵","author":"许传霈","text":"潇洒画中人，风怀回出尘。\n山林聊写韵，泉石迭为宾。\n廿载光阴迅，三生面目真。\n披图一想像，应是卧云身。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":44157,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}}]